      "name": "dsh-auto-retry",
      "title": {
        "en": "Auto Retry & Resume",
        "zh": "自动重试与续跑"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Retries a failed model request with exponential backoff, then resumes the same session after a delay when a round still fails, until the task completes or a bounded attempt budget is spent.",
        "zh": "模型服务或某一轮运行失败后，先按指数退避自动重试失败的模型请求；仍然失败则在设定的延时后自动续跑同一会话，直到任务完成或达到次数上限。"
      },
      "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
      "author": "Mark930209 <guimaxingtian@163.com>",
