      "name": "dsh-composer-skill-picker",
      "title": {
        "en": "Project Skill Picker",
        "zh": "项目技能选择器"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds a compact button to the composer tool row whose popup panel filters between project and global skills: project skills are discovered from the current project's .agents/skills and .dsh/skills by path, and a pick inserts /name.",
        "zh": "在输入框工具行常驻一个短按钮，点开浮层面板后用复选框切换「项目技能 / 全局技能」：项目技能按路径自动发现当前项目的 .agents/skills 与 .dsh/skills，选中即插入 /技能名。"
      },
