    {
      "name": "@guimaxingtian/dsh-file-tree",
      "title": {
        "en": "File Tree Enhancements",
        "zh": "文件树增强"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Add Git awareness to the workspace file tree: changed files are tinted with letter badges, folders aggregate their changes, and the files header shows the branch with its unpushed/unpulled commit counts. Right-clicking a file or folder adds a menu to attach it to the conversation, copy paths/links, preview in DSH, open a terminal, summarize or explain with AI, create/rename/delete entries, and reveal it in the file manager.",
        "zh": "给工作区文件树加上 Git 状态：改动文件着色与字母徽标、目录聚合着色、文件页头显示分支与未推送/未拉取提交数。右键文件或文件夹还有一套菜单：加入对话、复制路径/链接、在 DSH 中预览、在终端打开、用 AI 总结/解释、新建/重命名/删除，以及在文件管理器中定位。"
      },
